   377	
   378	        A run is a maximal chain where each successive occurrence sits at
   379	        last + g*p for 1 <= g <= max_gap_copies+1 (g-1 skipped copies = diverged
   380	        copies absorbed). Vectorised with NumPy so it scales to the millions of
   381	        occurrences a dinucleotide has on a whole chromosome.
   382	
